  "Increase <link\\=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> cap to $1 stacks, all foes will never drop below $2 stacks of <link\\=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link>.\\nIn <link\\=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>, [Sinful Game] no longer remove <link\\=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link>; <link\\=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> is upgraded to [Execution], increase [Execution] damage by $3 and deal $4 damage as splash damage to all foes. [Execution] can trigger all effects of <link\\=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link>.": "",
